# Approval Service
error-appr-action-invalid = The action in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-affects-invalid = What this approval affects is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-already-decided = This approval has already been decided.
error-appr-asker-may-not-approve = You can't approve your own action when it sends something outside the company. Ask someone else.
error-appr-attachment-not-allowed = Your company doesn't allow attachments from that place.
error-appr-card-already-decided = Someone has already decided this approval elsewhere.
error-appr-card-closed = The work ended before you decided, so this approval is closed.
error-appr-card-ref-invalid = That approval link isn't valid. Open the approval again.
error-appr-card-ref-mismatch = That button belongs to a different approval. Open the approval again.
error-appr-card-ref-unknown = ordin doesn't recognise that approval. It may be out of date.
error-appr-changes-invalid = The changes in this approval are too long or empty. Shorten them and try again.
error-appr-consequence-invalid = The consequence in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-content-label-invalid = The label on the content in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-content-too-large = The content in this approval is too large. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-decision-mismatch = The record of who decided and when doesn't fit this approval's state. Try again.
error-appr-destination-invalid = The destination in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-emit-failed = ordin couldn't record your decision, even after trying twice. Try again.
error-appr-not-an-approver = You aren't one of the people who can approve this.
error-appr-not-found = ordin can't find that approval. It may have been removed.
error-appr-operator-not-allowed = Only the named approvers can decide this approval.
error-appr-question-invalid = The question in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-recipient-not-allowed = Your company only allows sending to people inside the company. Choose another recipient.
error-appr-records-too-many = This approval lists too many affected records. Keep it to 1,000 or fewer.
error-appr-show-details-without-content = Details can't be shown because there is no content to show. Add content or turn details off.
error-appr-store-unavailable = ordin couldn't save or read this approval. Try again in a moment.
error-appr-verb-invalid = The action word in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
error-appr-where-invalid = The place named in this approval is too long or empty. Shorten it and try again.
